Subject: [PATCH] perf(dsv41): optimize vocab packing, confidence head, MoE,
 sampling, and spec-decode

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
with candidate-55's series applied through 0810.

Rationale: Vectorizes expert scale-code SWAR packing, in-place BF16 vocabulary
packing, confidence head, MoE GEMM, TileLang sampling/input preparation, and
DSpark speculative drafting/verification paths on SM121.

Quality implications: None; outputs match unpatched kernels across unit and
greedy Markov speculative verification tests.

Tests: pytest -q -p deepseek_models
tests/kernels/moe/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_moe.py
tests/kernels/quantization/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_vocab.py
tests/kernels/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_confidence.py
tests/v1/worker/test_dspark_greedy_markov.py.

Upstream status: local candidate-60 patch
